## Overview

This repository contains my Week 1 Lab submission for Object-Oriented Programming. The lab focuses on designing real-world objects using OOP concepts such as encapsulation, method overloading, edge-case handling, and reference variables in Java.

It includes:
* Car Class Demo (Part A of the assignment: Encapsulation, State Management, and Autopilot functionality)
* Calculator Class Demo** (Part B of the assignment: Basic Arithmetic, Edge-case handling, Power, Modulus, and Varargs)
* UML digrams of both
* Sample Outputs for both programs matching exact console execution



